(module asl/web/tests/stylesTokensTest :x [runTests RunTests testDarkPaletteTokens testLightPaletteTokens testSpatialScaleModularity testCssPropertiesRendering testDualPolarityRefutations] :i [(../src/styles :a styles)])

fn testDarkPaletteTokens -> Bool
  (let [(dark (styles/getDarkPalette))] (assert (= (styles/getToken dark "ground") "#0C0914") "Dark ground token matches") (assert (= (styles/getToken dark "surface") "#181327") "Dark surface token matches") (assert (= (styles/getToken dark "inset") "#110D1D") "Dark inset token matches") (assert (= (styles/getToken dark "line") "#302648") "Dark line token matches") (assert (= (styles/getToken dark "lineStrong") "#8866C6") "Dark lineStrong token matches") (assert (= (styles/getToken dark "ink") "#F6F4FF") "Dark ink token matches") (assert (= (styles/getToken dark "inkMuted") "#988CAF") "Dark inkMuted token matches") (assert (= (styles/getToken dark "signal") "#B060FF") "Dark signal token matches") (assert (= (styles/getToken dark "accent") "#C084FC") "Dark accent token matches") (refute (!= (styles/getToken dark "ground") "#0C0914") "Refute non-canonical ground") (refute (!= (styles/getToken dark "ink") "#F6F4FF") "Refute non-canonical ink") (refute (!= (styles/getToken dark "signal") "#B060FF") "Refute non-canonical signal") true)

fn testLightPaletteTokens -> Bool
  (let [(light (styles/getLightPalette))] (assert (= (styles/getToken light "ground") "#F8F7FC") "Light ground token matches") (assert (= (styles/getToken light "surface") "#FFFFFF") "Light surface token matches") (assert (= (styles/getToken light "inset") "#F4F2F8") "Light inset token matches") (assert (= (styles/getToken light "line") "#E1DBEC") "Light line token matches") (assert (= (styles/getToken light "lineStrong") "#9280B0") "Light lineStrong token matches") (assert (= (styles/getToken light "ink") "#181224") "Light ink token matches") (assert (= (styles/getToken light "inkMuted") "#706286") "Light inkMuted token matches") (assert (= (styles/getToken light "signal") "#7E22CE") "Light signal token matches") (assert (= (styles/getToken light "accent") "#9333EA") "Light accent token matches") (refute (!= (styles/getToken light "ground") "#F8F7FC") "Refute non-canonical light ground") (refute (!= (styles/getToken light "ink") "#181224") "Refute non-canonical light ink") (refute (!= (styles/getToken light "signal") "#7E22CE") "Refute non-canonical light signal") true)

fn testSpatialScaleModularity -> Bool
  (let [(scale (styles/getSpatialScale))] (assert (= (styles/getToken scale "gap0") "0px") "gap0 is 0px") (assert (= (styles/getToken scale "gap1") "4px") "gap1 is 4px") (assert (= (styles/getToken scale "gap2") "8px") "gap2 is 8px") (assert (= (styles/getToken scale "gap3") "12px") "gap3 is 12px") (assert (= (styles/getToken scale "gap4") "16px") "gap4 is 16px") (assert (= (styles/getToken scale "gap5") "20px") "gap5 is 20px") (assert (= (styles/getToken scale "gap6") "24px") "gap6 is 24px") (assert (= (styles/getToken scale "gap8") "32px") "gap8 is 32px") (refute (!= (styles/getToken scale "gap2") "8px") "Refute gap2 not 8px") (refute (!= (styles/getToken scale "gap4") "16px") "Refute gap4 not 16px") (refute (!= (styles/getToken scale "gap6") "24px") "Refute gap6 not 24px") true)

fn testCssPropertiesRendering -> Bool
  (let [(css (styles/renderCssCustomProperties))] (assert (> (stringLength css) 0) "Rendered CSS is non-empty") (assert (stringContains? css ":root") "Contains :root block") (assert (stringContains? css "--asl-ground: #0C0914;") "Contains dark ground var") (assert (stringContains? css "--asl-signal: #B060FF;") "Contains dark signal var") (assert (stringContains? css "--asl-accent: #C084FC;") "Contains dark accent var") (assert (stringContains? css "[data-theme=\"light\"]") "Contains light mode override") (assert (stringContains? css "--asl-ground: #F8F7FC;") "Contains light ground override") (refute (= (stringLength css) 0) "CSS length must not be 0") (refute (not (stringContains? css "--asl-")) "Must refute lack of --asl- prefix") (refute (stringContains? css "undefined") "Must refute undefined token strings") (refute (stringContains? css "NaN") "Must refute NaN token strings") true)

fn testDualPolarityRefutations -> Bool
  (let [(dark (styles/getDarkPalette)) (light (styles/getLightPalette))] (refute (= (styles/getToken dark "ground") (styles/getToken light "ground")) "Dark and light grounds must differ") (refute (= (styles/getToken dark "ink") (styles/getToken light "ink")) "Dark and light inks must differ") (refute (= (styles/getToken dark "signal") (styles/getToken light "signal")) "Dark and light signals must differ") true)

fn runTests -> Bool
  (do (testDarkPaletteTokens) (testLightPaletteTokens) (testSpatialScaleModularity) (testCssPropertiesRendering) (testDualPolarityRefutations) true)

fn RunTests -> Bool
  (runTests)
